1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,486
Now dicot versus monocot.

2
00:00:02,486 --> 00:00:10,052
A dicot root has few xylem groups, usually two to six: diarch, triarch, up to hexarch.

3
00:00:10,052 --> 00:00:12,734
Ranunculus is commonly tetrarch.

4
00:00:12,734 --> 00:00:17,981
Xylem fills the centre, so the pith is absent or tiny.

